### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### =====================
### App Controller
### =====================

### Get Hello
GET {{baseUrl}}

### =====================
### Users - CRUD Operations
### =====================

### Create User 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "age": 25
}

### Create User 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "secret456",
  "age": 30
}

### Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Update User
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "age": 26
}

### Delete User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Get User (should return 404 after delete)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
